 "notes": "Full 41-name board roster from the 'Board Officers, Members & Staff' page (undated). Treasurer is listed as Vacant there, though the older Committees page still names Henry Pelayo as Treasurer. Committee rosters come from the Committees page and use its spellings verbatim; they include names not on the current board roster (e.g. Chiene Jones, Derrick Holman, Jennifer Sayers, Loretta Masterson, Miriam Sanchez, Norma Saunders, Elizabeth Angeles, Janelle Halper, Henry Pelayo Jr.), which may be community members or departed members - the site does not distinguish. The two pages disagree in places: the officers page lists the Parks & Recreation chair as Vacant while the Committees page names Chiene Jones; spelling variants include Mohammed/Mohammad Mujumder, Mitchell/Mitchel Halpern, Antionette/Antoinette Vereen, Shante Chamblee/Chamble, Andrea McLoed/McLeod. Board-roster spellings are used for members; committee entries keep the Committees-page text. The officers page also lists NYCHA vice chair as Sadie Marie Davis vs Anne Johnson on the Committees page. A Disability Sub-Committee under Social Services is mentioned without a roster. Staff (District Manager William Rivera, Deputy District Manager Shirley SanAndres-Alonzo, District Director Tan'yah Jolly) excluded."
